# stage priority reason
# Read only when EDGEVISOR_SHADOW_ALLOCATION=file. priority and reversed
# sample at startup instead and never open this file.
# equal:    every stage the same weight.
# priority: sample temperature, power, and TCP round trip at startup; the
#           worst known reading sets the weight.
# reversed: sample as priority, then swap low and high.
# file:     read this file.
# Weights: low=2 mid=3 high=4. Missing stages stay mid.
0 low dedicated-and-plugged-in
1 high mobile-unplugged
2 mid shared-workstation
3 low dedicated-and-plugged-in
